==English==
===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[paper]] [[trail]]}}

#{{idiom}} A written [[record]], [[history]], or collection of [[evidence]].
#:''Keep a good '''paper trail''' in case anyone asks you why you arrived at that conclusion.''
# {{idiom}} the records left by a person or organization in the course of activities.

